        <fieldNames>Check_Issued_Date__c</fieldNames>
        <info>&lt;p&gt;Marketing Services Team: Please note the Credit Memo/Check number and issue date in the &amp;quot;Accounting Use Only&amp;quot; section once the payment has been processed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</info>
